WEBVTT

00:09:29.763 --> 00:09:31.046
like scavenger hunts.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:33.547
And some companies help people
find lunchtime buddies

00:09:33.571 --> 00:09:36.354
by using an app like one
called Never Eat Alone.

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:39.334
So managers need
an assortment of strategies

00:09:39.358 --> 00:09:42.709
to encourage connection
for different sorts of people,

00:09:42.733 --> 00:09:44.533
which is what Vivek tried next.

00:09:44.557 --> 00:09:45.926
He started small.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.571
VM: If we had a half-hour break,

00:09:47.595 --> 00:09:51.413
sometimes we would just take a small group
of people down to the gym downstairs,

00:09:51.437 --> 00:09:55.126
and we would just shoot hoops together
and chat, you know, for 15, 20 minutes.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:57.946
So we tried to create
opportunities during the day

00:09:57.970 --> 00:09:59.490
for people to socialize,

00:09:59.514 --> 00:10:02.806
but without spending
necessarily a huge amount of time.